"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/issues>`__. And we will "
"implement your translation."
msgstr ""
"请在 `Github issue <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/issues>`__ 上发布"
" Mission Planner 目录内「translation」文件夹内容的链接，我们将采用您的翻译。"
